## Ecosystem

- **Nuvemshop / Tiendanube**: Core SaaS e-commerce platform for creating, managing, and scaling online stores with full customization, multi-channel selling (online store, social media, marketplaces, POS), and integrated analytics
- **Nuvemshop Next / Tiendanube Next**: Enterprise-tier solution for high-volume brands, featuring dedicated account management, assisted migration, and custom technical development
- **Nuvem Pago**: Integrated payment solution with zero extra transaction fees for platform merchants
- **Nuvem Envio**: Native shipping solution with freight savings, batch label generation, automatic tracking, and carrier integrations
- **Nuvem Marketing**: Marketing automation platform (acquired Perfit in 2023) for email campaigns, cart recovery, post-purchase flows, smart segmentation, and performance reporting
- **Nuvem Chat**: AI-powered WhatsApp customer service that automates support in the brand's voice, available 24/7
- **App Store**: Marketplace with 700+ third-party apps for marketing, management, logistics, sales channels, and store customization

## Business Model (SaaS)

Nuvemshop/Tiendanube operates a freemium SaaS model with tiered subscription plans. All plans include unlimited products, visits, and sales. All paid plans include a free trial.

