## Technology and Features

- Transparent checkout with accelerated payment (saved customer data)
- AI-powered tools: product descriptions, institutional pages, SEO optimization, image editing
- Multi-channel selling: online store, Instagram Shopping, Facebook Store, Google Shopping, WhatsApp, TikTok, Pinterest, marketplaces (Mercado Livre/Libre, Amazon, Shopee)
- Point of Sale (POS) integration for physical retail
- B2B wholesale support with role-based pricing and minimum order rules
- 70+ responsive themes with full HTML/CSS/JS source code access
- REST API for third-party integrations
- SSL certificates included on all stores
- Mobile app (iOS and Android) for store management
- Native analytics dashboards

